# What the image must never contain. .env first: the Dockerfile copies the
# repo root, and a secrets file that ships inside a public image is a leak
# that no amount of "secrets in env not code" discipline undoes.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.git
.github
.vscode
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
__pycache__
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info

# Trained models and data live in the database or on a volume, not in the
# image. The committed LoRA adapters are 35MB of Phase 6 evidence that the
# API never loads (SKILL_EXTRACTOR=rules).
artifacts
data
# Except the company list the board sources read: the daily ingest job runs
# from this image, and without it every board source fails at startup.
!data/companies_in.yaml
docs
tests
monitoring
scripts
Makefile
docker-compose.yml
README.md
LICENSE
